Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the end of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All teams retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grid 1-9's too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have killed them\Nall if we stuck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to end\Nthe day like this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That team's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting them won't\Nhelp with our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a big mission coming\Nup, and we need to stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miller, the people from the NSA are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send them in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Miller,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd like to retain the services of GloGen\NDefense Systems for a top-secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the nature of the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.40,0:01:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To acquire a piece of tech\Ncalled Soul Translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not familiar with what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Japanese company called\NWrath developed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a machine capable\Nof analyzing a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, it's been verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this soul translation tech,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not only can Wrath scan and\Nread a soul, they can clone it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The project is codenamed ALICE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and its goal is to develop an artificial\Nsoul to pilot military drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of tech would disrupt\Nthe balance of power in East Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is concerned and wants to\Nkeep that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the specifics of the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a mega-float moored\Nnear the Izu Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the Ocean Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you to infiltrate the facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,secure the soul translation\Ntech, and bring it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to raid a Japanese\Nvessel, one of our allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a contact inside the JSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be sure to leave the\Nwindow open for you on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use whatever methods you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep in mind this is off the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get any support from the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll assemble a team and\Nlead this mission myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice, your soul will be\Nsweet, maybe the sweetest yet.
