Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that again, Critter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.54,0:04:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, Vassago, but it\Nwon't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lock on this system's\Ntougher than dried shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could try and crack it\Nwith the laptop we brought,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'd die of old age before I got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They booned us, and there's\Nnothing I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ain't all you said,\Nyou four-eyed scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:05:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said we wouldn't be stuck like this\Nif we weren't so slow getting in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just pointing out the faxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of waiting for the all-clear,\Nyou're coming up front with us, you pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys better cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to start\Npointing fingers at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out how\Nto deal with the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me put this worm in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone did what they were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aside from Gary getting\Ngrazed, the team's intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that we're in the control room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're exactly where we need\Nto be to get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get what done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't get access to the system, then\Nwe can't get what we came here to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The schematic said everything's automated,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the light cube cluster\Nthings behind a wall of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all we have to do now is figure\Nout a way to breach that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, the SDF agents on board\Nain't gonna hide in their holes forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when that ship outside\Nfigures out what's what,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be up to our ass in soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The client told me they have a\Nspecial relationship with the JSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They assured me we'd have a Hero\Nwindow before the ship rolled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's way better than a\Nboring old smash-and-grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go over the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stormed the facility 40 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's 1447 local time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're standing in the main\Ncontrol room of the Ocean Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been locked out of the system,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were unable to capture any\NWrath staff to help us unlock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A minor setback, not the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new objective is to infiltrate the\Nsub-control room and try from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Brig, do you think it's possible\Nto cut through the bulkhead door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not with the kind of gear we brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made out of some kind of\Nrock-hard composite material.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we gotta be out of here in 24,\Nthe portable saw ain't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need something bigger and sharper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hans, can we use C4 to blow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I wouldn't recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chamber with the light cube cluster is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to be on the other\Nside of the wall there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we blow the door, we'd risk damaging\Nthe chamber and everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow we have to find one light cube\Nin a vault of thousands and retrieve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the cube's ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we have a working console, we\Ncan eject it along with its interface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God we brought Senior\NDork along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that BS about hacking the Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were really that good you would\Nhave had this system open by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to the super\Nsoldier up to now the only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,combat you've seen's been\Nthe virtual kind Haas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God damn nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back empty-handed and\Ninstead of a big fat bonus get laughed at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna let some amateur\Nprogrammers lock you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then think, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come up with a way to get in and prove\Nyou got more than oatmeal in your skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressurized bulkhead leading to the\NLight Cube cluster can't be breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find some other\Nway to access it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admin privileges can't unlock the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is bring\Nup a visual of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we can see what all\Nthe Fluctlights are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, watch them living their lives\Nin their little fairy tale kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know your fantasy tropes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem kind of big for regular goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those things are hop goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:08:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Critter. Hmm, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those creatures part\Nof the system, like NPCs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not according to what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all got their own light cube designation,\Nwhich means they're in the cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things all have souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those hobgoblins have human souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same as us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, check out what the\Nother light cubes got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, maybe they're all filled\Nwith goblin and orc souls, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Alice is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The underworld is split into the human\Nempire where, you know, humans live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And surrounding that, on the\Nother side of the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the dark territory\Nwhere the monsters are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a name like Alice, I'm pretty\Nsure she's both a she and human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, the human part\Nis so big and filled with people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll never find her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sitting out here, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in there we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they got a civilization, they can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just drop me in and I can\Nask around till I find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:09:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop and think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's tens of thousands of\Npeople living in the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge and you're just one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're someone with\Nsome clout. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The researchers must have special\Naccounts they could use to log in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a safe bet those\Naccounts would be a higher
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,level than the average\Ncitizen isn't that right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,critter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, boss exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of all the ranks and classes the wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peeps had to set aside\Na few to use that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could monitor and\Ntweak the world from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about if I log in as a general\Nor president or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give the order to find Alice and\Nlet the grunts do the work Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I hear you say it, I'm not\Nso sure I'm a fan of the idea anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:11:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got all these high-level accounts\Nlocked down as tight as the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we dive into the Human Empire, it's\Ngonna be as a plain old low-level person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time, search for any high-level\Naccounts outside the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but the chances of Alice being\Nin Monsterland is close to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if all that separates the two regions\Nare mountains, they can be crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's why you're in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always thinking outside the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll dive in as a boss monster\Nand leader raid on the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be down with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I think I found a couple contenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No password required.\NGents, specs look good this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one's classified as a\Ndark knight so edgy and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His object control levels\Nat 70 he's a badass to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bone sweet right up\Nmy alley yo i got dibs on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark knight i found\Nanother account that we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can access well that's\Nweird there's no rank and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it Doesn't have a level\Neither no durability system
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,control authority the\Nonly setting is its name
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vector hell yeah\Nthat guy's the king of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the monster world changed\Nmy mind i'll be him no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use that account, all\Nright, bro. You're the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i'm cool being a dark\Nknight Let's get this show on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the road i want to chop some\Nfools with my sword come on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,four eyes what Do we gotta\Ndo to log in speak up critter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's obviously\Nbothering you maybe i'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being Overcautious but i keep\Nseeing the same term pop up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again and again in these\Nlogs it might not Affect our
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Op, but still go on. What is\Nthis term? The final load test.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do i put this as far as kirito's real
