Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world condition it's\Nlike i said before Things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't looking too good for him the only
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing that gives me hope\Nis he's still Logged
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the underworld that's good see even\Nthough his self-image is damaged his Flux
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,light still active and\Nreceiving stimuli so
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a chance his\Nneural network can heal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, his guilt over losing his\Nfriends is what damaged his soul, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if, and it's a big what\Nif, what if someone forgave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send me. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Log me into the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to tell him that he did all\Nhe could. That he did his best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's okay that after\Nall the pain and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Know he suffered in\Nthe end he did the best
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he could all right we have\Nanother STL we can use
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Underworld is at\Na critical stage. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not exactly stable right\Nnow it's scheduled to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enter the final load test\Nsoon, the last phase of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the experiment final load\Ntest what happens then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eastern gate separates\Nthe human empire from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark territory once\Nits durability Level hits
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,zero the monsters will\Ninvade the human side if
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the humans were able to\Nbuild up Their defenses
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in time they could drive\Nthe monsters back to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their side but now it's\Nup in The air kirito
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty much destroyed the\Naxiom church the ruling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Body there, so who knows\Nwhat will happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this point having someone\Ndive in there might
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the best course of\Naction for all Our concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:15:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once the invasion begins\Nthere's no telling how
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chaotic the underworld\Nwill get And there's a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good chance alice could\Nbe killed but if we send
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone in using a high\Nlevel account They could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find Alice and have the\Npower to keep her safe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long enough to get her\Nto the World End's altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, using the terminal there, they can\Neject her light cube to this control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's why you told Kirito\Nto take her there, to eject her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd have gotten her there\Nby now, if he were able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was right there with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time there's accelerated, so\Nby now months have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think there's a chance\Nthey're still together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's a good bet they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And personally, I think if anyone's\Ngonna dive in, it should be Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's our best hope at\Nbreaking through to Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's got the combat skills to\Nprotect Alice and get her to the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to convince me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's find her a\Nhigh-level account to dive in with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got tons of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A knight, a general, a noble, whatever\Nyou pick's gonna have high stats, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the people in main con?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're here for Alice, maybe\Nthey've got the same idea we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two STLs over there\Nthey can use. Thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the passwords I set for the\Nhigh-level accounts are tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they won't have time to crack them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they dive in, they can\Nonly go as a level one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's nothing.
