Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's risky, but there's a chance\NDaddy's Fluctlight can be repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Mommy dove into the\NUnderworld to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if she can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you guys stop worrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito's always pulled through before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand that\Nthey're stuck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those hijackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they figure\Nout how to get to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something we can\Ndo, except sit around and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.74,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If worse comes to worse, I'll\Nbe calling on you for help.
