Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so formal.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.43,0:20:13.06,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF0EDEE&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\pos(978.18,862.533)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(12,132,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(25,145,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(38,158,\alpha&H00&)}k {\alpha&HFF&\t(51,171,\alpha&H00&)}K{\alpha&HFF&\t(64,184,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(76,196,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(89,209,\alpha&H00&)}g{\alpha&HFF&\t(102,222,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(115,235,\alpha&H00&)}t {\alpha&HFF&\t(128,248,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(140,260,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(153,273,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(166,286,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(179,299,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(192,312,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(205,325,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(217,337,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(230,350,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(243,363,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(256,376,\alpha&H00&)}V{\alpha&HFF&\t(269,389,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(281,401,\alpha&H00&)}x{\alpha&HFF&\t(294,414,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(307,427,\alpha&H00&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(320,440,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(333,453,\alpha&H00&)}l {\alpha&HFF&\t(345,465,\alpha&H00&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(358,478,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(371,491,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(384,504,\alpha&H00&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(397,517,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(410,530,\alpha&H00&)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But officially, I'm still on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were familiar warned\Nof an impending emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it that serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pontifex of the Axiom Church is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That immortal being? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I too found it hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I spent the past week confirming it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, perfect for... For peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that still possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe that, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it's possible or not, it\Nmust be achieved, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, my lord, you would first have to\Nconvince the other nine in the council, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would the Order of Integrity Knights even\Nentertain peace negotiations with us? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe the Integrity\NKnights would be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Pontifex is dead, then I'd\Nwager old man Bercouli is in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand him, but he is reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this,\Nbut the only thing that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could get in the way of peace\Ntalks would be our Council of Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not all, just four
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord, that's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could handle the Goblin Chiefs\Nand the Orc Chief. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head of the Dark Mages Guild\Nwould be difficult, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hopes to find the Secret to\Nadministrators immortality and one day become
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Empress peace would get in the way of her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ambitions precisely that is why you cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take the chance my lord as I said the\Ngoblin and orc chiefs are no match for you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she is diabolical I can't imagine what\Nkind of evil spell she has up her sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.98,0:22:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Lipia. How long have\Nyou and I been together?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, um, since I turned 21, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, four years now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That long, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.28,0:22:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made you wait far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe now we could, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make it official and\Nbecome husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I were younger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency! It's an emergency!\NCome to the Throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,room the chain that seals\Nthe door is trembling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
